"benchmark is the \"quanto barriers: analytic against the PDE\" section "
"near the end. The three grid presets it sweeps are `FdParameters` "
"`PRESET_COARSE`, `PRESET_STANDARD` and `PRESET_FINE`."
msgstr ""

